           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Uncategorized" rel="category tag">Uncategorized</a> | <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2012/08/easy-github-code-reviews-with-diffgist-in-psgist/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on Easy Github Code Reviews with diffgist in PsGist"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="1286 http://cromwellhaus.com/?p=1286">1 Comment</span></a>              </span>
